WEBVTT

00:00:06.127 --> 00:00:09.043
...but could you at least
tell me where we're going?
不过至少告诉我我们要去哪

00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:12.960
[panting heavily]

00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:21.317
You dragged me...
你大老远…

00:00:21.447 --> 00:00:23.057
...all the way out here...
把我拖来这里

00:00:23.188 --> 00:00:24.624
...for a bath?
就是要我洗澡？

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:33.111
Panda... we do not wash our pits
in the Pool of Sacred Tears.
熊猫
我们不会在圣泪池洗胳肢窝的…

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:35.418
Huh?
The Pool of...
什么池？

00:00:35.548 --> 00:00:38.072
This is where Oogway
unraveled the mysteries...
是乌龟大师调气和修行的圣地

00:00:38.203 --> 00:00:40.205
...of harmony and focus.
是乌龟大师调气和修行的圣地

00:00:40.336 --> 00:00:42.860
This is the birthplace...
这里是功夫的起源地

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.427
...of kung fu.
这里是功夫的起源地

00:00:47.081 --> 00:00:48.431
[gasps]

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.617
Do you want to learn kung fu?
你真想学功夫吗？

00:01:00.747 --> 00:01:04.838
- Yeah!
- Then I am your master!
那我就是你的师傅

00:01:04.969 --> 00:01:07.885
OK! [sniffs]
太感人了

00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:09.147
Don't cry.
不要哭

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:11.584
OK. [sniffing]
好的

00:01:16.241 --> 00:01:18.287
When you focus
on kung fu,
当你只想着要学武功…

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:22.116
when you concentrate...
you stink.
当你只想着要学武功…

00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:23.944
But, perhaps, that is my fault.
不过也许这是我的错

00:01:24.075 --> 00:01:27.600
I cannot train you the way
I have trained the Five.
我不能用传统的方法教你

00:01:27.731 --> 00:01:30.777
I now see that the way
to get through to you...
唯一的方法是借由食物来点化你

00:01:30.908 --> 00:01:32.126
...is with this.
唯一的方法是借由食物来点化你

00:01:32.257 --> 00:01:36.870
- Oh, great, 'cause I am hungry.
- Good.
太棒了 我快饿死了

00:01:37.001 --> 00:01:39.873
When you have been trained,
you may eat.
等你练完功才能吃东西

00:01:41.048 --> 00:01:42.441
Let us begin.
开始练功吧

00:01:42.572 --> 00:01:44.965
[Po grunting]

00:01:48.142 --> 00:01:51.102
Whoa! Oh... [yells]

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:57.326
[shouting]

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:00.851
Yah! Yah!

00:02:17.476 --> 00:02:18.695
Ow!

00:02:34.798 --> 00:02:36.321
Yah!

00:02:38.454 --> 00:02:40.194
Yah!

00:02:52.946 --> 00:02:56.123
- [Shifu] After you, panda.
- Just like that?
就这么简单？

00:02:56.254 --> 00:02:59.692
No sit-ups? No ten-mile hike?
不做仰卧起坐？不跑山路？

00:02:59.823 --> 00:03:02.478
I vowed to train you,
and you have been trained.
我发誓会训练你 我也做过了…
你可以吃包子

00:03:02.608 --> 00:03:04.610
You are free to eat.
我发誓会训练你 我也做过了…
你可以吃包子

00:03:09.876 --> 00:03:11.617
Enjoy.
请慢用

00:03:12.923 --> 00:03:14.490
- Hey!
- [munching]

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:17.841
I said you are free to eat.
Have a dumpling.
我说你可以吃包子 吃呀

00:03:18.972 --> 00:03:20.626
Hey!

00:03:26.763 --> 00:03:28.547
You are free to eat.
你可以吃包子

00:03:28.678 --> 00:03:30.854
- Am I?!
- Are you?!
-才怪
-你行吗？

00:03:32.246 --> 00:03:33.857
Whooaa...

00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:49.568
[laughing]

00:03:58.925 --> 00:04:00.057
Whoo!

00:04:02.668 --> 00:04:04.496
Ow! Ow!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.119
[both grunting]

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.259
[panting]

00:04:31.088 --> 00:04:34.483
[both shouting]

00:04:39.096 --> 00:04:41.011
[chortles]

00:04:57.114 --> 00:04:58.768
I'm not hungry.
我不饿了

00:05:02.249 --> 00:05:03.555
Master.
师傅

